{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想再等到心里全明白，便先接下自己能做的一份。\",\n      \"key\": \"先接下自己能做的一份\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"结果还没把握，可真做起来，他有了些力气，也有点骄傲，越投入越觉得痛快。\",\n      \"key\": \"越投入越觉得痛快\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他还惦记着从前珍惜的东西，如今却不能像过去那样自然地拥有。\",\n      \"key\": \"从前珍惜的东西\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一感觉到失落，就赶紧盯住眼前的事，反复告诉自己撑得住，越说越显出他其实很在意。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复告诉自己撑得住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心就这样垮下去，可一想到仍放不下的事，刚鼓起的劲又松了，他越发急着撑住自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"不甘心就这样垮下去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再等到彻底想清、先承担自己能做之事的第一次转变，改成具体的行动，不再用抽象的行动原则表达。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\", \"R8\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"合并行动带来的力量、骄傲、投入的热切和尽力本身的痛快，保留上一轮评审明确要求保留的收获；删去重复的主体性总结，不再把他写成已经不审视自己、毫无顾虑地投入。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的心里一小部分没有跟上高昂，改成他仍惦记着从前珍惜、如今不能自然拥有的东西。保留行动与旧日依恋并存的心理事实，为后面坚定无法安抚他、依恋逐渐显出原样留下连续性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"原来不再审视自己、不会因软弱停步的说法与B4相反。改成他察觉失落后努力把心思收回眼前，反复劝自己撑得住，越劝越显出在意，解释自我控制如何变得勉强。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足\",\n      \"why\": \"把力量为何一再聚起又松动写清：他不甘心垮下去，却仍被放不下的事牵回去，只好急着重新撑住。既解释B3的反复推进与焦灼，也解释B5的不甘心，避免把这股激昂误写成恢复了轻松自信。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f5411f0b-0911-4f93-93ad-e0627a81738f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T233002656816Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:31:34.594377+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1e760d2e78bc2f56b34a55d43917cf2242fcddbb1cc65eebc0fb8529a9aad656", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T233002656816Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "defa7e4270fdfaa9d7298d127b4abd5dfaf05c7a325ad1619d778eb297e71783"}}}
